0.3.0
  * New features:
    * `r` now refreshes the current page
    * `PageUp` and `PageDown` does not wraps the selected line around
    * Verify before downloading that the file link stays in the same origin
      that is to say same scheme (`http`, `https`, ...) and host (example.com)
  * documentation and README updates
  * The cache does not get old refreshed (and outdated) pages
  * Code simplification for ratatui initialization and termination
0.2.0
  * New ChangeLog file (this one ;-)
  * `Clap` for the command line argument parsing (adds --version and --help)
  * No more default url : if None is provided the program won't run
